title: 'pallet-revive: map eth-rpc errors to EIP-1474 error codes'
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev]
  description: |-
    The Ethereum JSON-RPC server (`pallet-revive-eth-rpc`) previously collapsed every
    `EthRpcError` other than a client error to the generic `-32600` (Invalid request)
    code. Each variant is now mapped to its appropriate EIP-1474 error code so that
    Ethereum tooling can react to RPC errors correctly.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive-eth-rpc
  bump: patch
